    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSituated at the front of this established development, facing the green area, this 3 bedroom mid terrace property is in a fantastic location in Lismore town within walking distance of all shops, schools, pubs and restaurants.Inside, there is a spacious lounge to the front with an open fireplace. The kitchen/dining room is to the rear. This room has a sliding glass door to the rear garden which has an enclosed lawned garden.Upstairs, the master bedroom is to the rear and has its own ensuite. The second and third bedrooms are to the front and are of ample size. The property is in good condition throughout and has plenty of parking space outside the front door. This property has a wide appeal and would suit as a holiday or retirement home, an investment property or would also be ideal for first time buyers looking to get their foot on the ladder. Viewing highly recommended.OFCH Acc: Ent hall, kit./dining, lounge, 3 beds (1 ens), bath, wc. 96.4 sq.m. (1,038 sq.ft.) approx.BER: C3 BER No: 106694144Energy Performance Indicator: 209.35 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.05m x 1.88m\nPVC door with opque glass panel, timber floor, painted walls, lights, telephone point, smoke alarm\n\nLiving Room - 4.17m x 3.58m\nTimber floor, painted walls, window to the front with blinds, centre light, open fireplace, t.v. point.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 3.15m x 6.07m\nVinyl Tiled floor, painted walls, window to the rear with blinds, sliding glass door to the rear, two centre lights, fitted kitchen.\n\nDownstairs W.C. - 1.45m x 0.76m\nVinyl floor, painted walls, whb, w.c., centre light, extractor fan.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 2.44m x 1.78m\nSolid timber floor, painted walls, centre light, hot press, smoke alarm, access to attic.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 2.97m x 3.53m\nSolid timber floor painted walls, window to the rear with curtains and blinds, centre light, telephone point.\n\nEnsuite - 0.9m x 2.6m\nTimber floor, painted walls, whb, w.c., Triton electric shower, extractor fan.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.38m x 3.05m\nSolid timber floor, painted walls, window to the front with blinds, centre light.\n\nBedroom Three - 3.5m x 2.5m\nSolid timber floor, painted walls, window to the front with curtains and blinds, centre light.\n\nBathroom - 2.16m x 1.8m\nTimber floor, painted walls, opaque window to the rear, whb, w.c., bath, centre light.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Town centre location. </li><li>Facing large green area. </li><li>Spacious living room. </li><li>Fine size rear garden.</li><li>Private parking. </li><li>Mains services.</ul>"
